{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/a-delegated-turn-s-returned-error-is-reported-in-its-child-room",
  "title": "A delegated agent whose output carries an error it met keeps its answer in the child room's trace, ON_ERROR fires once there as for a turn that raised, and the task fails with that error, marked reported",
  "rules": [
    "§10.2 step 3c",
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§9.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: core/event_router.py react_for (an output's error surfaces as a raised one's, its output going on); core/mixins/_child_execution.py _broadcast_and_collect (_report_intelligence_errors, category generation), _buffered_outcome (a responded output's rows kept, its error the turn's failure, handed on as it is: no end named, no narration), _collect_answer (mark_reported); tasks/models.py finished_task_fields (error_reported).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "helper",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Look it up."
            },
            "respond": [
              {
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "Partial."
                }
              }
            ],
            "output": {
              "error": "The provider stopped."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "parent",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "errors",
        "trigger": "on_error",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "parent",
      "agent_id": "helper",
      "task": "Look it up.",
      "wait": true,
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "status": "failed",
          "result": {
            "status": "failed",
            "output": null,
            "error": "The provider stopped.",
            "metadata": {
              "error_reported": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "hooks": {
      "errors": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_error",
          "room_id": "$r1",
          "event": {
            "chain_depth": 1,
            "responds_to": "$r1#0",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "helper",
              "direction": "inbound"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "The provider stopped."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "error": "The provider stopped.",
              "error_category": "generation"
            },
            "type": "message",
            "correlation_id": {
              "$absent": true
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "timeline": {
      "parent": [],
      "$r1": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "system"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Look it up."
          }
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "helper"
          },
          "chain_depth": 1,
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Partial."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
